# CPE vendor↔product index ships with the image (Tier 3 OS validation in
# hybrid_cpe_normalizer). Without it the api logs "CPE dictionary not found"
# on every boot and CPE validation silently degrades. Whitelist mirrors the
# exact_match_cache_compact.json pattern above.
!src/modules/asset_generation/domain/os_normalization/cpe_vendor_product_index.json
*.pkl
*.cbm
*.bak

